{"h":"<h2>简介</h2><p>这是我的紧凑型<a href=\"https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">舒适用户界面</a>工作流程。我尽量保持直观。就像提示一样：少即是多。它应该简单明了。我在构建它时考虑了从左到右的逻辑流程，您应该很容易阅读和理解。</p><h2>特点</h2><ul><li><p>提示作曲家</p></li><li><p>带遮罩的 Img2img</p></li><li><p>集成绘画编辑器</p></li><li><p>统一控制网</p></li><li><p>IP适配器</p></li><li><p>XY 图</p></li><li><p>高分辨率修复（第二遍）</p></li><li><p>升级</p></li><li><p>图像比较器</p></li><li><p>CivitAI 元数据输出</p></li></ul><h2>节点</h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI管理器</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/jags111/efficiency-nodes-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">效率节点</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-自定义脚本</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/asagi4/comfyui-prompt-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI提示控件</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">rg Three 的 ComfyUI 节点</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Lerc/canvas_tab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">画布选项卡</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/nkchocoai/ComfyUI-SaveImageWithMetaData\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">使用元数据保存图像</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Gourieff/comfyui-reactor-node\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI 的 ReActor 节点</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/tudal/Hakkun-ComfyUI-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Hakkun-ComfyUI-节点</a></p></li></ul>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h2>Introduction</h2><p>Here's my compact<a href=\"https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI</a>workflow. I try to keep it as intuitive as possible. Like prompting: less is more. It should be straightforward and simple. I build it with a left-to-right logical flow in mind, that you should easily read and understand.</p><h2>Features</h2><ul><li><p>Prompt Composer</p></li><li><p>Img2img with mask</p></li><li><p>Integrated Painting editor</p></li><li><p>Unified ControlNet</p></li><li><p>IP-Adapter</p></li><li><p>XY Plots</p></li><li><p>HighRes-Fix (2nd Pass)</p></li><li><p>Upscaling</p></li><li><p>Image Comparer</p></li><li><p>CivitAI metadatas output</p></li></ul><h2>Nodes</h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-Manager</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/jags111/efficiency-nodes-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Efficiency Nodes</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/asagi4/comfyui-prompt-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI prompt control</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">rgthree's ComfyUI Nodes</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Lerc/canvas_tab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Canvas Tab</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/nkchocoai/ComfyUI-SaveImageWithMetaData\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">SaveImageWithMetaData</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Gourieff/comfyui-reactor-node\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ReActor Node for ComfyUI</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/tudal/Hakkun-ComfyUI-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Hakkun-ComfyUI-nodes</a></p></li></ul>"}}